    ri_fd1  : fd_lookup (m_fds model) (Z_to_bv 64 1) = Some (FdChannel (Z_to_bv 64 1));
    ri_fd2  : fd_lookup (m_fds model) (Z_to_bv 64 2) = Some (FdChannel (Z_to_bv 64 2)) }.

